        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 29:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.29.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.29.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "HOS.12.12"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Hos 12:12",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Yakobo yaagumizamu orugyendo rwe, yaahika omu nsi y'abantu b'oburugwa-izooba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.29.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.29.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 29:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yaimutsya amaisho, yaareeba eiziba omu ishwa, n'amasyo ashatu g'entaama gabyami haihi naryo; ahabw'okuba aha iziba eryo niho baabaire bageeshera; eibaare eryabaire riri aha munwa gw'eiziba rikaba riri rihango munonga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.29.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.29.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 29:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amasyo goona ku gaabaire gateeranira aho, abariisa baiha eibaare aha munwa gw'eiziba, beeshera, bwanyima barigaruraho.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.29.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.29.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 29:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.29.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.29.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 29:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yakobo yaabuuza abariisa ati: Beene waitu, nimuruga hi? Baamugarukamu bati: Nituruga Harani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.29.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.29.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 29:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yaababuuza ati: Nimumanya Labaani mwene Nahori? Banu bati: Nitumumanya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.29.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.29.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 29:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yaababuuza ati: Ariyo agumire? Banu bati: Agumire. Nangwa reeba, na Rakeeli muhara we, nguriya naija n'entaama. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.29.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.29.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 29:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yakobo yaagira ati: Reeba, bukiri omu ihangwe, n'obunaku bw'okuzaagiza amasyo tibukahikire; mweshere entaama, mugyende muziriise. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.29.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.29.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 29:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Baamugira bati: Titurikubaasa, amasyo goona gatakateeraine, bakaiha eibaare aha munwa gw'eiziba, tukabona kweshera entaama.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.29.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.29.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 29:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.29.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.29.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 29:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.29.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.29.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EXO.2.16"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Kur 2:16",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ",",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EXO.2.17"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "17",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Ku yaabaire naakigamba nabo, Rakeeli yaija n'entaama za ishe; ahakuba niwe yaabaire aziriisa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.29.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.29.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 29:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yakobo ku yaareebire Rakeeli muhara wa Labaani nyinarumi n'entaama ze, yaahika aha iziba, yaiha eibaare aha munwa gwaryo, yaayeshera entaama za Labaani nyinarumi ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.29.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.29.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 29:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yakobo yaanywegyera Rakeeli, yaimutsya eiraka, yaarira naaborooga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.29.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.29.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 29:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yaayetondera Rakeeli ku aine obuzaare na ishe, kandi ku ari mutabani wa Rebeka. Rakeeli yairuka, yaabigambira ishe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.29.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.29.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 29:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "GEN.24.29"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Kut 24:29",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Labaani ku yaahuriire ebigambo bya Yakobo omwihwa, yairuka kumubugana, yaamubumbatira, yaamunywegyera, yaamutaasya omu ka ye. Yakobo yaagambira Labaani ebyabaireho byona. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.29.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.29.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 29:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Labaani yaamugira ati: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.29.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.29.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29:14:",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Omu Ruheburaayo, ori eigufa ryangye kandi omubiri gwangye",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Buzimazima ori owangye ow'aha mara. Yaaguma nawe okumara okwezi kwona.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.29.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.29.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 29:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.29.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.29.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 29:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bwanyima Labaani yaamubuuza ati: Beitu shi, oshemereire kunkorerera busha, ngu ahakuba twine obuzaare? Okaayenzire ku nkuha bihembo ki? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.29.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.29.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 29:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kandi Labaani akaba aine abaishiki babiri; eiziina ry'omukuru akaba ari Lea, kandi ery'omuto ari Rakeeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.29.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.29.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 29:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lea akaba ataine maisho garikwera; kwonka Rakeeli akaba ari murungi munonga w'okurigirwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.29.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.29.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 29:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "GEN.31.41"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Kut 31:41",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " N'ahabw'ekyo Yakobo akakunda Rakeeli. Yakobo nikwo kugarukamu Labaani ati: Niinyija kukukorera emyaka mushanju, ompingire Rakeeli muhar waawe omuto. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.29.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.29.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 29:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Labaani yaamugarukamu ati: Ni kirungi okumukuha okukira okumuha ondiijo muntu weena. Guma naanye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.29.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.29.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 29:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "SNG.8.7"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Kyesh 8:7",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Atyo Yakobo yaakora emyaka mushanju ahabwa Rakeeli; kandi egyo myaka yaamubeera nk'ebiro bikye, ahabw'okukunda oku yaabaire naamukunda.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.29.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.29.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 29:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.29.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.29.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 29:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bwanyima Yakobo yaagira Labaani ati: Mpingira omukazi wangye, mmushwere, ahabw'okuba mpikize ebiro byangye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.29.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.29.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 29:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JDG.14.10"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Bar 14:10",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ",",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JDG.14.12"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "12",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Labaani yaateeka obugyenyi, yaayeta abantu boona ab'omuri ogwo mwanya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.29.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.29.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 29:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omu mwabazyo yaareeta muhara we Lea, yaamuhingira Yakobo, yaamushwera. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.29.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.29.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 29:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kandi Labaani yaaha muhara we Lea omuzaana we Zilupa kuba omuzaana we. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.29.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.29.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 29:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omu kasheeshe Yakobo yashanga ari Lea; yaayetomboitera Labaani, naagira ati: Beitu shi, ongizire ota? Tindakukoreire ahabwa Rakeeli? Mbwenu ongobereize ki? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.29.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.29.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 29:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Labaani yaagira ati: Owaitu tikwo tugira, okuhingira omuto omukuru atakashweirwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.29.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.29.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 29:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Banza omare saabiti n'ogwo, haza tukuhingire n'ogu, ogarukye onkorere endiijo myaka mushanju. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.29.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.29.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 29:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yakobo yaakora atyo; yaamara saabiiti na Lea; bwanyima Labaani yaamuhingira Rakeeli muhara we. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.29.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.29.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 29:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kandi Labaani yaaha Rakeeli omuzaana we Biliha kuba omuzaana we. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.29.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.29.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 29:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "GEN.31.41"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Kut 31:41",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Atyo Yakobo yaashwera Rakeeli; kandi yaamukunda munonga okukira Lea; yaagaruka yaakorera Labaani endiijo myaka mushanju.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.29.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.29.30"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
